{
  "_comment": "AUTHORITATIVE shared fixtures for Wallet dApp Connect / WalletConnect v2 (docs/WALLET-WALLETCONNECT.md §5). IDENTICAL across blockle-extension/walletconnect.js (JS, reference — authored these), blockle-app/lib (Dart), python/blockle (Python). The relay transport + WC crypto are ABSTRACTED behind an injected relay (tests inject a FAKE relay); these vectors pin the SESSION + REQUEST state machine + the SECURITY integration only. TRUST MODEL: an external dApp is UNTRUSTED — every signing request requires explicit human approval AND runs the security pre-sign gate; NO dApp request auto-approves. Money is base-unit/BigInt-exact. 'nowMs' is the injected clock the request/expiry cases assume. Error codes: 3001 unauthorized (namespace), 4001 user-rejected, 4100 eth_sign-disabled, 4201 session-expired, 4202 unknown-topic, 4203 unsupported-chain, 5000 fail-closed (no approval/confirm handler).",
  "version": 1,
  "nowMs": 1760000000000,
  "addresses": {
    "account": "0xAbCdEf0000000000000000000000000000000001",
    "spender": "0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111",
    "recipient": "0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222",
    "token": "0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48",
    "operator": "0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111"
